OL,3,GNEWSAItalian square named after
OL,4,Amurdered musician loved by Mary, Queen
OL,5,Aof Scots
OL,6,
OL,7,FA town in northern Italy has renamed a
OL,8,Fsquare after a musician and private
OL,9,Fsecretary to Mary, Queen of Scots, who
OL,10,Fwas brutally murdered at Holyrood
OL,11,FPalace.
OL,13,FIn 1566, David Rizzio was in the
OL,14,FQueen's private apartment when
OL,15,Fconspirators burst in, pushed her aside
OL,16,Fand dragged Rizzio away before stabbing
OL,17,Fhim 56 times.
OL,19,FThe mayor of Moretta officially opened
OL,20,FPiazzetta David Rizzio earlier to
OL,21,Fcommemorate his journey from the region
OL,22,Fto the Scottish royal court.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
