OL,3,GNEWSAItalian square named after
OL,4,Amurdered musician loved by Mary, Queen
OL,5,Aof Scots
OL,6,
OL,7,FGianni Gatti said: "We feel a deep
OL,8,Fconnection with this story and wanted
OL,9,Fto make sure all the people of Moretta
OL,10,Fknew about our link with Scotland."
